                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Better Homes, the city’s premier cleaning service provider, is offering a special promotion this month. Let our teams of professional cleaners make your home look as good as new. We offer various cleaning services, including vacuuming, mopping, and window washing. We can clean either one of your rooms or your entire house. If you call now to arrange a cleaning session, you will receive a 30% discount. This offer is only good for the next two weeks until the end of the month though. If you visit our Web site at www.betterhomes.com, you can check out our prices. The most commonly requested service is listed at the top.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
